{"about_the_game":"GORB is a Physics based puzzle game, with simple mechanics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInspired by Red Remover, your goal is to remove all Red and Orange shapes from the screen, while ensuring that the Green shapes remain on screen. Follow along with the in-game tutorial to learn the simple rules.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you have what it takes to complete all 168 levels?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 7 Worlds<br />\r\n- 168 levels<br />\r\n- Collectable Bonus Stars<br />\r\n- Interactive tutorial to help you learn the rules of the game<br />\r\n- Colorful characters, simple to play, fun for all ages<br />\r\n- Simple and fun game mechanics<br />\r\n- Works great on touch based devices","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"e46f2b48afabb253c54f053e23dfebd48ea4f67b.jpg","localized_name":"Star Power","name":"Star Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/612310/e46f2b48afabb253c54f053e23dfebd48ea4f67b.jpg"},{"icon":"30c0c6d0ef057d94a652ce97e0d423e427f841cc.jpg","localized_name":"Star Collector","name":"Star Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/612310/30c0c6d0ef057d94a652ce97e0d423e427f841cc.jpg"},{"icon":"7a78dde04a94bff7287f6fb727472b3f7174873d.jpg","localized_name":"Star Hunter","name":"Star Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/612310/7a78dde04a94bff7287f6fb727472b3f7174873d.jpg"},{"icon":"cb994aedcc86f6670841eb277bb28070f46d1354.jpg","localized_name":"Star Master","name":"Star Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/612310/cb994aedcc86f6670841eb277bb28070f46d1354.jpg"},{"icon":"2ee3fcb0502c5a3d50e3ecf9c8c603e8200bdf11.jpg","localized_name":"Ultra Star","name":"Ultra Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/612310/2ee3fcb0502c5a3d50e3ecf9c8c603e8200bdf11.jpg"},{"icon":"301508b61ab3b6efbcb3ee1cc9589cc706e8ab6d.jpg